<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets $250 million five-year FRN,call.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets $250 million five-year FRN,call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST NEW YORK CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  SPREAD     +12.5 BP  MATURITY   *15.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.932    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.932</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER THREE YEARS.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
